> ../../../alpha/alpha/interrupt.c
> /var/tmp/ccaf2165.s: Assembler messages:
> /var/tmp/ccaf2165.s:425: Error: macro requires $at register while noat in
> effect
> /var/tmp/ccaf2165.s:443: Error: macro requires $at register while noat in
